<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“I will be God to them” declares the Lord,</l><l>Christ, our inheritance, described in God’s Word;</l><l>“And they will be to Me a people,” possessed</l><l>As God’s inheritance, His riches expressed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“For all will know Me” and consecrate,</l><l>Even the little ones and also the great;</l><l>All have capacity to live such a life;</l><l>All live in oneness, abiding in Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“I will propitiate,” forgiving sin,</l><l>Cleansing the inward parts and washing within;</l><l>Christ’s efficacious blood has set us free,</l><l>Restoring fellowship eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
